<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal direct insurance premiums fall in April.</title>
<headline>Portugal direct insurance premiums fall in April.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total accumulated income from Portuguese direct insurance premiums fell in April to 254.8 billion escudos from 260.1 in the same period last year, the Portuguese Insurers Association (APS) said.</p>
<p>Income from life insurance premiums fell to 92.6 billion from 101.9 billion while total non-life premiums rose to 162.2 billion escudos from 158.2 in April last year.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
